Stopgap, one line, gets you testing today. On fremont:

Open the file and add a local constant just above the patch block, right after auto currentSizes = currentMemRefType.getShape();:

cpp
    constexpr bool preserveTightlyCoupledLayout = true;

Then rebuild:

bash
distrobox enter a5-ubuntu
cd ~/work/ascend/AscendNPU-IR
export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH"
bash build-tools/build.sh -o build-ubuntu -j 32

Only that one object needs recompiling plus the link, so minutes not hours.

